 get an orthonormal basis:\n\n- ${u}_{1}=\\frac{{v}_{1}}{‖{v}_{1}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-3\\sqrt{14}}{14} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{7} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{14}\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- ${u}_{2}=\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{4}^{2}}}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} \\\\ \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\end{aligned}].$\n\nTherefore, $B={{u}_{1},{u}_{2}}={[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-3\\sqrt{14}}{14} \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{7} \\\\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{14}}{14}\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} \\\\ \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\end{aligned}]}$ is an orthonormal basis of $V.$\n\nFinally, $a=0,$ $b=\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5},$ $c=\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}$ and  \n\n$$\n|a|+|b|+|c|=|\\,0\\,|+|\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}|+|\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}|=\\frac{3\\sqrt{5}}{5}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-86854/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ccdefb8e-1bb5-52e9-812d-d2a5bffff731"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-86854"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140526/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "fb8da38d-2a9a-5822-80a5-2b33c6eeabf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140526/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "a8b7040e-060d-5de5-aa54-ed36a74842c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140526/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "2aef1cad-2085-56eb-96cc-582c5dfdb6dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140526/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c8